    "name": "FastDOL Auth Webhooks API",
    "description": "FastDOL aggregates federal workplace enforcement records on 2.3M US employers across 16 federal agencies \u2014 OSHA, WHD, MSHA, EPA ECHO, NLRB, FMCSA, OFLC, BLS SOII, SAM.gov, CMS, USAspending, CPSC, NHTSA, SEC, and the UVA Corporate Prosecution Registry. Query inspections, violations, penalties, wage theft cases, severe injury reports, recalls, and federal contract awards via a single, normalized JSON API.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: FastDOL Support\n Email: ben@fastdol.com",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "createdAt": "2026-07-28T01:37:07.000Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-07-28T01:37:07.000Z",
